{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.946,"lines":[{"text":"Intro]","t":22.64,"e":22.84,"w":[["Intro",22.64,22.84]],"ok":0.0},{"text":"Dix ans... dix ans à attendre le verdict.","t":22.94,"e":25.5,"w":[["Dix",22.94,23.16],["ans",23.2,23.28],["dix",23.34,23.54],["ans",23.58,23.72],["à",23.82,23.86],["attendre",23.92,24.44],["le",24.5,24.6],["verdict",24.68,25.5]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"C'est fini, là.","t":26.18,"e":27.28,"w":[["C'est",26.18,26.36],["fini",26.44,26.94],["là",27,27.28]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai croisé son regard, il avait tout du prince charmant","t":35.88,"e":39.04,"w":[["J’ai",35.88,36.02],["croisé",36.04,36.36],["son",36.42,36.58],["regard",36.64,37.24],["il",37.3,37.42],["avait",37.48,37.72],["tout",37.94,38.06],["du",38.12,38.32],["prince",38.38,38.58],["charmant",38.62,39.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le swag, la classe, ce sourire qui m'a fait perdre tout discernement","t":39.24,"e":43.18,"w":[["Le",39.24,39.32],["swag",39.38,39.58],["la",39.64,39.72],["classe",39.88,40.18],["ce",40.24,40.36],["sourire",40.44,40.9],["qui",40.96,41.06],["m'a",41.24,41.34],["fait",41.4,41.56],["perdre",41.62,41.88],["tout",41.94,42.08],["discernement",42.14,43.18]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Il m’a dit : « Tu seras ma femme, la mère de mes enfants »","t":43.78,"e":47.2,"w":[["Il",43.78,43.86],["m’a",43.92,44.04],["dit",44.08,44.18],["Tu",44.24,44.34],["seras",44.36,44.56],["ma",44.62,44.82],["femme",44.94,45.4],["la",45.46,45.74],["mère",45.94,46.2],["de",46.26,46.36],["mes",46.42,46.6],["enfants",46.68,47.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai cru à chaque mot, je me suis abandonnée, tout simplement","t":47.24,"e":51.38,"w":[["J’ai",47.24,47.36],["cru",47.4,47.56],["à",47.62,47.7],["chaque",47.74,47.94],["mot",47.98,48.14],["je",48.2,48.24],["me",48.28,48.38],["suis",48.44,48.62],["abandonnée",48.7,49.72],["tout",50.16,50.3],["simplement",50.38,51.38]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dix ans sont passés, nos souvenirs s'empilent comme des pierres","t":52.1,"e":55.16,"w":[["Dix",52.1,52.24],["ans",52.28,52.38],["sont",52.42,52.56],["passés",52.62,53.16],["nos",53.24,53.34],["souvenirs",53.4,53.84],["s'empilent",53.9,54.34],["comme",54.42,54.58],["des",54.62,54.8],["pierres",54.86,55.16]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais je suis juste l'invitée, jamais la reine de sa terre.","t":55.22,"e":59.08,"w":[["Mais",55.22,55.32],["je",55.38,55.52],["suis",55.58,55.84],["juste",55.94,56.36],["l'invitée",56.4,57.24],["jamais",57.4,57.84],["la",57.9,58.06],["reine",58.12,58.36],["de",58.4,58.48],["sa",58.56,58.72],["terre",58.78,59.08]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quel genre de diplôme tu veux avoir ?","t":59.14,"e":61.98,"w":[["Quel",59.14,59.34],["genre",59.38,59.72],["de",59.78,59.9],["diplôme",60,60.54],["tu",60.6,60.8],["veux",60.88,61.08],["avoir",61.18,61.98]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dans ton championnat tu es là, il n’y a plus de prolongations","t":63.1,"e":65.9,"w":[["Dans",63.1,63.2],["ton",63.24,63.36],["championnat",63.38,64.04],["tu",64.1,64.22],["es",64.28,64.38],["là",64.42,64.56],["il",64.64,64.7],["n’y",64.72,64.8],["a",64.8,64.84],["plus",64.88,65.02],["de",65.02,65.02],["prolongations",65.06,65.9]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quel genre de diplôme tu attends pour tourner la page ?","t":67.12,"e":71.11,"w":[["Quel",67.12,67.36],["genre",67.4,67.74],["de",67.8,67.9],["diplôme",67.98,68.54],["tu",68.58,68.68],["attends",69.13,69.33],["pour",69.57,69.77],["tourner",70.02,70.22],["la",70.47,70.67],["page",70.91,71.11]],"ok":0.5},{"text":"C’est quelle étude qui ne finit pas , si tu ne veux pas faut me libérer ?","t":71.36,"e":75.2,"w":[["C’est",71.36,71.52],["quelle",71.56,71.78],["étude",71.84,72.2],["qui",72.24,72.3],["ne",72.34,72.38],["finit",72.44,72.92],["pas",72.92,73.2],["si",73.4,73.5],["tu",73.54,73.62],["ne",73.66,73.7],["veux",73.74,73.86],["pas",73.9,74.02],["faut",74.08,74.2],["me",74.24,74.38],["libérer",74.42,75.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Oh bébé ! (Dis-moi pourquoi)","t":75.26,"e":78.88,"w":[["Oh",75.26,75.36],["bébé",75.42,75.6],["Dis-moi",78.1,78.38],["pourquoi",78.44,78.88]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Oh bébé ! (Tu me gardes là)","t":79.2,"e":80.28,"w":[["Oh",79.2,79.36],["bébé",79.42,79.84],["Tu",79.9,80.1],["me",79.96,80.16],["gardes",80.02,80.22],["là",80.08,80.28]],"ok":0.33},{"text":"Oh bébé ! (Je ne suis plus ta proie)","t":80.14,"e":81.34,"w":[["Oh",80.14,80.36],["bébé",80.44,80.88],["Je",80.92,81.12],["ne",80.97,81.17],["suis",81.01,81.21],["plus",81.05,81.25],["ta",81.09,81.29],["proie",81.14,81.34]],"ok":0.25},{"text":"Oh bébé !","t":81.18,"e":84.06,"w":[["Oh",81.18,81.38],["bébé",81.44,84.06]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Il me regarde de haut, comme un expert analyse un sujet","t":84.14,"e":87.22,"w":[["Il",84.14,84.24],["me",84.26,84.38],["regarde",84.44,84.78],["de",84.78,84.82],["haut",85.26,85.34],["comme",85.42,85.58],["un",85.64,85.72],["expert",85.78,86.1],["analyse",86.18,86.58],["un",86.64,86.72],["sujet",86.76,87.22]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Il dissèque mes humeurs, il scrute mes failles, il veut tout vérifier","t":87.78,"e":91.2,"w":[["Il",87.78,87.86],["dissèque",87.92,88.36],["mes",88.42,88.62],["humeurs",88.64,89.36],["il",89.4,89.46],["scrute",89.5,89.7],["mes",89.72,89.84],["failles",89.9,90.08],["il",90.12,90.18],["veut",90.22,90.34],["tout",90.42,90.54],["vérifier",90.58,91.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Il dit qu'il m'étudie, qu'il cherche à voir si je suis la \"bonne\"","t":91.3,"e":94.88,"w":[["Il",91.3,91.36],["dit",91.42,91.52],["qu'il",91.56,91.68],["m'étudie",91.74,92.2],["qu'il",92.24,92.36],["cherche",93.56,93.76],["à",93.82,93.86],["voir",93.9,94.04],["si",94.1,94.18],["je",94.24,94.26],["suis",94.26,94.36],["la",94.44,94.54],["bonne",94.58,94.88]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais pendant ses tests, c'est ma jeunesse qui doucement résonne","t":95.1,"e":98.94,"w":[["Mais",95.1,95.2],["pendant",95.26,95.52],["ses",95.58,95.72],["tests",95.92,96.2],["c'est",96.24,96.36],["ma",96.4,96.52],["jeunesse",96.6,97.38],["qui",97.6,97.84],["doucement",97.92,98.38],["résonne",98.44,98.94]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je suis devenue son laboratoire, sa chambre d’observation","t":99.1,"e":102.86,"w":[["Je",99.1,99.18],["suis",99.24,99.36],["devenue",99.42,99.68],["son",99.74,99.86],["laboratoire",99.92,100.74],["sa",101.4,101.5],["chambre",101.54,101.84],["d’observation",101.88,102.86]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Pendant que je compte les années, lui, il compte mes imperfections.","t":103.1,"e":106.88,"w":[["Pendant",103.1,103.26],["que",103.26,103.34],["je",103.42,103.52],["compte",103.58,103.74],["les",103.76,103.92],["années",104,104.22],["lui",104.28,104.74],["il",105.12,105.18],["compte",105.22,105.38],["mes",105.44,105.74],["imperfections",105.8,106.88]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Suis-je une erreur dans ton calcul ?","t":107.42,"e":110.12,"w":[["Suis-je",107.42,108.12],["une",108.18,108.28],["erreur",108.36,108.88],["dans",108.96,109.22],["ton",109.28,109.4],["calcul",109.46,110.12]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ou juste une peur que tu n'assumes pas ?","t":111.26,"e":114.32,"w":[["Ou",111.26,111.36],["juste",111.44,111.64],["une",111.72,111.88],["peur",111.94,112.36],["que",112.44,112.86],["tu",112.96,113.2],["n'assumes",113.24,113.88],["pas",113.98,114.32]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu étudies mon comportement...","t":115.12,"e":116.98,"w":[["Tu",115.12,115.24],["étudies",115.32,115.74],["mon",115.78,115.88],["comportement",115.94,116.98]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais tu ne vois pas que mon amour se meurt entre tes mains.","t":117.24,"e":120.74,"w":[["Mais",117.24,117.34],["tu",117.38,117.48],["ne",117.5,117.56],["vois",117.6,117.84],["pas",117.9,118.06],["que",118.1,118.2],["mon",118.26,118.42],["amour",118.5,118.86],["se",118.92,119.02],["meurt",119.06,119.24],["entre",119.26,119.52],["tes",119.58,119.8],["mains",119.88,120.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quel genre de diplôme tu veux avoir ?","t":123.12,"e":125.74,"w":[["Quel",123.12,123.34],["genre",123.4,123.72],["de",123.78,123.94],["diplôme",124.04,124.56],["tu",124.62,124.82],["veux",124.88,125.08],["avoir",125.14,125.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dans ton championnat tu es là, il n’y plus de prolongations","t":127.1,"e":130.1,"w":[["Dans",127.1,127.18],["ton",127.24,127.34],["championnat",127.36,127.88],["tu",128.1,128.2],["es",128.26,128.36],["là",128.42,128.58],["il",128.64,128.7],["n’y",128.74,128.82],["plus",128.92,129.04],["de",129.06,129.08],["prolongations",129.12,130.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quel genre de diplôme tu veux avoir ?","t":131.12,"e":133.8,"w":[["Quel",131.12,131.34],["genre",131.38,131.74],["de",131.8,131.94],["diplôme",132.04,132.54],["tu",132.62,132.8],["veux",132.88,133.08],["avoir",133.46,133.8]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"C’est quelle étude qui ne finit pas , si tu ne veux pas faut me libérer ?","t":135.38,"e":139.2,"w":[["C’est",135.38,135.52],["quelle",135.56,135.76],["étude",135.86,136.2],["qui",136.24,136.3],["ne",136.32,136.38],["finit",136.44,136.84],["pas",136.92,137.32],["si",137.4,137.48],["tu",137.52,137.6],["ne",137.64,137.68],["veux",137.72,137.84],["pas",137.9,138.02],["faut",138.08,138.18],["me",138.22,138.36],["libérer",138.42,139.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Oh bébé !","t":139.28,"e":139.88,"w":[["Oh",139.28,139.36],["bébé",139.42,139.88]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les examens sont terminés.","t":157.76,"e":160.3,"w":[["Les",157.76,157.92],["examens",158,158.58],["sont",158.64,158.86],["terminés",158.94,160.3]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je ne veux plus être ton objet d'étude.","t":161.08,"e":164.72,"w":[["Je",161.08,161.18],["ne",161.24,161.36],["veux",161.4,161.56],["plus",161.6,161.92],["être",162,162.36],["ton",162.44,162.66],["objet",162.74,163.36],["d'étude",163.42,164.72]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je veux juste... être aimée.","t":165.64,"e":168.2,"w":[["Je",165.64,165.88],["veux",165.94,166.6],["juste",166.66,167.04],["être",167.24,167.52],["aimée",167.58,168.2]],"ok":1.0}]}